<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 19.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 19.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     Sept 19     Sept 18	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  240.250     240.710     237,040    1.35 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  301.600     301.580     303.640   -0.67 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.170     159.220     165.490   -3.82 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.712	46.850	48.410   -3.51 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  374.720     374.200     366.280    2.30 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  142.030     142.085     147.886   -3.96 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.762	15.777	14.975    5.26 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  219.700     218.600     230.135   -4.53 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.892	 1.888	 1.939   -2.42 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.560	 1.559	 1.575   -0.95 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  194.060     194.040     206.030   -5.81 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
